        <mxCell id="YUn7ZV3SV-XNvTl7icqt-1" value="Build a system like APNS or FCM to deliver push notifications to devices&lt;div&gt;FR:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Different types of push notifications with different priorities like booking OTP vs marketing push notifications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Assumptions:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Billions of devices. -&amp;gt; 2 B&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Millions of apps. -&amp;gt; 5 M&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. A single app could be installed on millions of devices (Max 200M devices).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. A notification will probably to sent to on an average 20% user base for any specific application.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;NFR:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Highly Available&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Scalable&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Resilient/Guranteed delivery&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. performant -&amp;gt; low latency (&amp;lt;1 sec)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Deliver once semantics&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
